                'description' => '<h3>Precision 2.2 kW Water-Cooled Electric Spindle (80mm)</h3><p>The HQD 2.2 kW water-cooled electric spindle motor is the standard benchmark for 3-axis CNC router beds (such as 1325 and 1212 formats) conducting high-speed detail engraving, acrylic fabrication, and light metal profiling. Featuring a slim 80mm outer diameter barrel machined from ground stainless steel, this spindle integrates smoothly into standard cast aluminum mounting brackets with minimal cantilever overhang.</p><p>Equipped with high-grade angular contact P4 bearings and dynamic rotor balancing, the GDZ-80-2.2KW operates up to 24,000 RPM at 400 Hz with minimal radial vibration (<0.005 mm runout). The internal water-cooling jacket ensures that heat generated by continuous cutting is dissipated via a steady stream of recirculating coolant, maintaining a stable temperature at the collet nose to eliminate thermal tool drift during multi-hour 3D relief jobs. The ER20 precision collet chuck accepts standard shank sizes from 1mm up to 13mm.</p><h4>Operating Parameters & Installation:</h4><ul><li>VFD Inverter Pairing: Designed for use with standard 2.2kW single-phase to three-phase 400Hz frequency inverters.</li><li>Cooling Connection: 8mm water tube fittings connect directly to submersible water pump or recirculating chiller.</li><li>Bearing Architecture: Dual 7005 P4 and dual 7002 P4 bearings handle combined axial plunging and radial milling forces.</li><li>Noise Level: Operates below 65 dB at full velocity, providing a quiet and fatigue-free working environment.</li></ul>',
